  "description": "Kang Min-A's daily life is completely turned upside down by the sudden acquisition of the ability to . Now, what unfolds before her are irreversible events caused by a single moment of choice. In the midst of anger, confusion, and suppressed sense of justice, Min-A begins a new journey, wondering where to use her power. In what direction will her power flow, and what choices will she make?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
